{"seq":2,"slug":"group-commit-throughput","title":"组提交与吞吐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice/group-commit-throughput","wordCount":1446,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"组提交与吞吐\">组提交与吞吐</h1><p>WAL 把提交的成本压到了&quot;顺序写一小段日志 + 一次 fsync&quot;，听起来已经很便宜了。但 fsync 才是真正的暴君——它要等数据真正落到非易失介质，一次可能耗时 0.5 到 10 毫秒。这意味着单线程串行提交的天花板，被一次 fsync 的延迟死死焊住：每秒最多几百到几千次。组提交（group commit）就是绕过这堵墙的关键技巧——让一次 fsync 替成百上千笔并发提交付账。这一篇讲它为什么有效、怎么实现、以及在复制场景下的纠缠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-fsync-是提交吞吐的瓶颈\">核心概念：fsync 是提交吞吐的瓶颈</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/why-wal\">为何需要 WAL</a>说提交只需顺序追加日志再 fsync。问题在于 fsync 的代价几乎与写入字节数无关——刷 200 字节和刷 200KB，耗时差不多，都被一次磁盘往返（或 SSD 的持久化屏障）支配。设单次 fsync 延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，若每笔提交各自 fsync 一次，单线程提交吞吐上限就是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TPS</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TPS}_{\\max} = \\frac{1}{T_f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2935em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f = 5\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时上限仅 200 TPS。无论 CPU 多快、日志多短，这个上限纹丝不动。它不是带宽瓶颈，是<strong>延迟瓶颈</strong>——而延迟瓶颈正是批处理的用武之地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组提交-一次-fsync-摊给一批事务\">组提交：一次 fsync 摊给一批事务</h2><p>观察到 fsync 代价与字节数近乎无关，思路就清晰了：与其让 100 个并发事务各自 fsync 100 次，不如把它们的日志攒在一起，<strong>一次 fsync 全刷掉</strong>。这 100 笔提交分摊同一次磁盘往返，单次 fsync 的成本被摊薄到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f / 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/100</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>实现上，提交线程不立刻自己 fsync，而是把日志追加进共享缓冲后进入一个短暂的&quot;集结窗口&quot;。某个 leader 线程负责发起 fsync，fsync 完成时，这段时间里集结进来的所有事务一起被判定为持久化、一起返回成功。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[事务 T1..Tn 几乎同时提交] --&gt; B[各自把日志追加进共享 WAL 缓冲]&#10;    B --&gt; C[进入集结窗口]&#10;    C --&gt; D[leader 发起一次 fsync&lt;br/&gt;覆盖窗口内全部日志]&#10;    D --&gt; E[fsync 完成]&#10;    E --&gt; F[窗口内所有事务一起&lt;br/&gt;判定持久化并返回成功]\">flowchart TD\n    A[事务 T1..Tn 几乎同时提交] --&gt; B[各自把日志追加进共享 WAL 缓冲]\n    B --&gt; C[进入集结窗口]\n    C --&gt; D[leader 发起一次 fsync&lt;br/&gt;覆盖窗口内全部日志]\n    D --&gt; E[fsync 完成]\n    E --&gt; F[窗口内所有事务一起&lt;br/&gt;判定持久化并返回成功]</pre><p>加入组提交后，吞吐上限被并发度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 放大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TPS</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TPS}_{\\max} \\approx \\frac{N}{T_f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>并发越高、攒得越多，单次 fsync 摊得越薄。这是 WAL 系统能在普通磁盘上跑出数万 TPS 的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟与吞吐的权衡\">延迟与吞吐的权衡</h2><p>组提交不是免费午餐，它用<strong>单笔延迟</strong>换<strong>整体吞吐</strong>。集结窗口越长，攒到的事务越多、fsync 越省，但每笔提交多等了一点窗口时间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>单笔提交延迟</th>\n<th>整体吞吐</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立即 fsync（无组提交）</td>\n<td>最低（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 死焊</td>\n<td>极低并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定等待窗口</td>\n<td>偏高（+窗口时长）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>稳定高并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应窗口（按负载动态调）</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>主流，负载波动大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代引擎多用自适应窗口：低负载时几乎不等（退化为立即提交，保低延迟），高负载时自动拉长窗口聚集更多事务（保吞吐）。这是一个典型的&quot;在延迟和吞吐之间随负载滑动&quot;的控制问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与复制-binlog-的纠缠\">与复制、binlog 的纠缠</h2><p>组提交在单机已经够妙，到了 MySQL 这种 redo + binlog 双日志系统（见<a href=\"wal-in-databases\">数据库中的 WAL</a>），它还多担一份责任——<strong>为复制确定全局提交顺序</strong>。</p>\n<p>MySQL 的 binlog group commit 把提交流水线切成三段，每段对一批事务串行处理：flush（写 binlog）、sync（fsync binlog）、commit（引擎层提交）。同一批事务在 binlog 里的写入顺序，就成了它们传给从库回放的顺序，也是基于 GTID 复制时的因果序。这意味着组提交的&quot;批&quot;不仅是性能单位，还是<strong>复制的一致性单位</strong>。一批内的事务被认为可以在从库上并行回放（它们提交时互不依赖），这正是 MySQL 多线程复制（基于 commit 时间戳/逻辑时钟）能加速的依据。</p>\n<p>当提交还要等远程从库确认（半同步/同步复制），延迟项从本地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成网络往返 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{net}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，组提交摊薄的对象也随之变成这个更昂贵的等待——并发度对吞吐的放大作用因此更显著。复制本身的语义留给<a href=\"wal-replication-beyond\">复制与超越恢复的用途</a>与兄弟 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程注意点\">工程注意点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>fsync 必须诚实</strong>：组提交的全部正确性建立在&quot;fsync 返回即落盘&quot;上。若存储栈说谎（写缓存未断电保护却报成功），组提交会把一批事务一起错误地判定为持久化，崩溃后一起丢——错误被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。</li>\n<li><strong>窗口不能太贪</strong>：窗口拉太长虽然 fsync 更省，但单笔延迟恶化、且窗口内事务持锁更久，可能加剧锁竞争，反噬吞吐。</li>\n<li><strong>与 WAL 缓冲争用</strong>：高并发下多个线程往同一 WAL 缓冲追加日志，缓冲的并发追加（lock-free 或细粒度锁）本身可能成为新瓶颈，需要专门优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>fsync 是延迟瓶颈，代价与字节数近乎无关，单线程提交上限被死焊在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>组提交把一批并发事务的日志攒成一次 fsync，吞吐上限放大到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，是 WAL 系统跑出高 TPS 的根本。</li>\n<li>它用单笔延迟换整体吞吐；自适应窗口在低负载保延迟、高负载保吞吐。</li>\n<li>在 MySQL 双日志下，组提交的&quot;批&quot;还兼任复制的全局顺序与并行回放单位。</li>\n<li>正确性依赖 fsync 诚实；窗口过贪、WAL 缓冲争用是主要工程陷阱。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章相邻篇：<a href=\"wal-in-databases\">数据库中的 WAL</a>（redo/binlog 双日志背景）、<a href=\"wal-replication-beyond\">复制与超越恢复的用途</a>（同步复制下的延迟项）。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../foundations/why-wal\">为何需要 WAL</a>（提交 = 顺序写 + fsync 的由来）、<a href=\"../foundations/log-structure-lsn\">日志结构与 LSN</a>（flushedLSN 水位）。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../database-replication-ha/foundations/sync-async-replication\">数据库复制与高可用（58）·同步异步复制</a>讲清半同步/同步复制如何改变提交的等待项。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组提交与吞吐","id":"组提交与吞吐"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：fsync 是提交吞吐的瓶颈","id":"核心概念-fsync-是提交吞吐的瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"组提交：一次 fsync 摊给一批事务","id":"组提交-一次-fsync-摊给一批事务"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟与吞吐的权衡","id":"延迟与吞吐的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"与复制、binlog 的纠缠","id":"与复制-binlog-的纠缠"},{"level":2,"text":"工程注意点","id":"工程注意点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"数据库中的 WAL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice/wal-in-databases"},"next":{"title":"复制与超越恢复的用途","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/practice/wal-replication-beyond"}}